    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133260/extras/ca1405dcdd481fed1cf84c134486cad2.avif?t=1602606110\" /></div><br><strong>VOLE COMPLEXITY</strong> is a Top-Down Puzzle-Game, which will boil your brain.<br>Charlie, the vole got lost and is searching a way back home. Do you have what it takes to find the way through all the mazes which are getting more and more complex?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\ufeff<li><strong>\u201eGoing Up?\u201c</strong> - It's the main mode of the game. Find the way out and bring Charlie back home.<br>Three different skill levels with 10 Floors for each (30 in total) will demand everything from you!<br><br></li><li> <strong>Collecting stars</strong>: Every maze has it's own specific minimum time and minimum steps you can theoretically make to beat the maze. If you find the fastest possible way through a maze you will earn a star which will unlock more achievments.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133260/extras/ca1405dcdd481fed1cf84c134486cad2.avif?t=1602606110\" /></div><br><strong>VOLE COMPLEXITY</strong> is a Top-Down Puzzle-Game, which will boil your brain.<br>Charlie, the vole got lost and is searching a way back home. Do you have what it takes to find the way through all the mazes which are getting more and more complex?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\ufeff<li><strong>\u201eGoing Up?\u201c</strong> - It's the main mode of the game. Find the way out and bring Charlie back home.<br>Three different skill levels with 10 Floors for each (30 in total) will demand everything from you!<br><br></li><li> <strong>Collecting stars</strong>: Every maze has it's own specific minimum time and minimum steps you can theoretically make to beat the maze. If you find the fastest possible way through a maze you will earn a star which will unlock more achievments.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "VOLE COMPLEXITY is a top-down puzzle-game, which will boil your brain. Guide Charlie the vole through a lot of different mazes which are getting more and more complex. Move bunches of blockers, outwit plenty of pits and bring Charlie back home savley.",
